ething attractive, such as our crush :P"}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Div.1 B"}],"kind":"strong"},{"kind":"text","text":": "}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Idea, authoring, solution, preparation by me. "}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The problem authored by me 2 days before the contest :D (#FastAsFerrari). Attractive girls are called (some word similar to) “Hos” in Persian. It’s a good place to thank "},{"attrs":{"href":"https://codeforces.com/profile/amsen"},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"amsen"}],"kind":"link"},{"kind":"text","text":", whose name (Hir) gave me this idea (to use word “Hos” instead of “attractive girl”)."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Div.1 C"}],"kind":"strong"},{"kind":"text","text":" : "}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Idea, authoring, solution by "},{"attrs":{"href":"https://codeforces.com/profile/Batman"},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Batman"}],"kind":"link"},{"kind":"text","text":", preparation by "},{"attrs":{"href":"https://codeforces.com/profile/Batman"},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Batman"}],"kind":"link"},{"kind":"text","text":" and me. "}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"“Kooft” is something make people die. “Zahre-mar” meaning is “Venom of Snake”."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Div.1 D"}],"kind":"strong"},{"kind":"text","text":": "}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Idea by "},{"attrs":{"href":"https://codeforces.com/profile/Batman"},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Batman"}],"kind":"link"},{"kind":"text","text":", authoring, solution, preparation by me. "}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"“Dokhtar-kosh” is an adjective, used when something is very very attractive."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Div.1 E"}],"ki